<title>MOROCCO: French loans Morocco $12.3 mln for irrigation.</title>
<headline>French loans Morocco $12.3 mln for irrigation.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Development Bank (La Caisse Francaise de Developpement) on Wednesday signed an accord to provide Morocco with a long-term 73-million franc ($12.3 million) loan to improve irrigation in the north of the country.</p>
<p>The loan will finance improvements to small and medium water units irrigating 10,000 hectares (25,000 acres), the official news agency MAP said.</p>
<p>No details of the term or interest rate were immediately available.</p>
</text>
